# Motorcomm YT921x unmanaged Ethernet switch driver

config YT9215_SWITCH
	tristate "Motorcomm YT921x unmanaged Ethernet switch support"
	depends on OF
	select SWCONFIG
	help
	  This driver supports the Motorcomm YT9215 / YT9218 series of
	  unmanaged Gigabit Ethernet switch chips (e.g. YT9215S, a 5-port
	  GE switch with internal PHYs and a RGMII CPU port).

	  The switch is accessed over the SoC's MDIO bus (via the
	  "motorcomm,mdio" Device Tree property) and exposes per-port
	  VLAN, link status, and statistics through the swconfig framework
	  (CONFIG_SWCONFIG).

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
	  will be called yt9215.
